"description":"Explore Align — The Ultimate macOS Window Management Experience\n\n---\n\nWindow management has never been this smart and efficient.\n\nAlign is a tailored innovation for macOS users, an app that manages your application windows with ease. With its intuitive design and robust features, align and arrange your windows effortlessly. Whether you're working on multiple screens, a single display, or in portrait orientation, Align helps you quickly and conveniently resize and position windows to boost your productivity.\n\nMain Features:\n\n- **Magnetic Snapping**: \nDrag windows to the screen's edge and experience the smart magnetic snapping, which automatically adjusts them to the perfect position, ensuring a clean and efficient desktop environment. Screen edges behave like magnets, perpetually poised to attract and settle windows into position.\n\n- **Customizable Shortcuts**: \n  Set up personalized shortcuts for swift window adjustments, enhancing your multitasking flow.\n\n- **Hotkey Menu**: \n  Anytime, anywhere, summon the hotkey menu with a single keystroke. Choose between panel or circular menu styles for rapid window management.\n\n- **Diverse Layout Options**: \n  A variety of layouts are available, such as vertical, horizontal arrangements, and corner distribution, allowing you to create personalized window layouts with ease.\n\n- **Color Themes and Multilingual Support**: \n  Pick from a selection of color themes for a visual treat. With multilingual support, enjoy a seamless user experience worldwide.\n\nExperience Now:\n\nAlign offers an efficient solution for multitasking operations. Whether you're handling documents in the office or enjoying leisure time at home, Align enhances your productivity and brings order to your desktop environment.\n\nDownload Align and Start Your Efficient Life Today!\n\n---\n\nDownload Align now on the App Store to make window management a breeze. Every move is a step towards a more efficient work and study experience.\n\n\n=====\n\nYour subscription includes a free trial period that begins once your purchase has been confirmed with your iTunes Account. When the trial period concludes, your subscription will start and renew automatically. Your iTunes Account will be charged for the upcoming period unless you disable auto-renew or cancel your subscription in your Account Settings at least 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. For terms and privacy visit:  https://www.swiftwave.cc/terms-privacy", "minimumOsVersion":"12.0", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "ZH", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"15345970", "formattedPrice":"Gratuito", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"4+", "sellerUrl":"https://www.swiftwave.cc", "userRatingCount":0}, 
